# Secondary Examples

#### 👉 Click on each Domain of the AILit Framework to explore how a teacher could make small changes to a lesson plan in order to integrate AI.

<!-- Engaging with AI - Secondary -->
<details style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto 14px auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; background:#FFFFFF; color:#292F36; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px;">
<summary onmouseover="this.style.background='#F2F4F7'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#FFFFFF'" style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 24px; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; color:#141414; list-style:none; border:1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius:16px; background:#FFFFFF; transition:background 0.2s ease;">
Engaging with AI
</summary>

<div style="padding:20px 24px 24px 24px;">
<div style="border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(41,47,54,0.08); border:1px solid #e3e6ea;">
<div style="background:#F4F6F8; padding:24px;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px; color:#0093A4;">Original Lesson</div>
<div>Students research the causes of the American Revolution using a textbook and curated primary and secondary sources. They take notes, identify key events and perspectives, and write a short paragraph explaining the main causes using evidence from their sources.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:#8C52BA; color:white; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:800;">→</div>

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#0093A4;">Small AI Shift</div>
<div>After completing their research, students ask an AI tool the same question and compare the response to their sources. They identify missing details, bias, or oversimplification, and revise their paragraph or add a reflection about whether the AI response should be trusted.</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:20px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:16px; color:#0093A4;">Framework Connections</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:16px;">

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/01bcfdad34fbe94df49a42fa383600d1-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.49 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Knowledge</div><div style="font-size:14px;">AI Reflects Human Choices and Perspectives; AI’s Role in Society</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/80cec506af206a17886dd8e93fddc5ce-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.44 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Skills</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Critical Thinking; Self and Social Awareness</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/a15746db2cd10f74f27ff30a58119a8b-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.39 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Attitudes</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Curious; Empathetic</div></div>
</div>

</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</details>


<!-- Creating with AI - Secondary -->
<details style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto 14px auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; background:#FFFFFF; color:#292F36; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px;">
<summary onmouseover="this.style.background='#F2F4F7'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#FFFFFF'" style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 24px; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; color:#141414; list-style:none; border:1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius:16px; background:#FFFFFF; transition:background 0.2s ease;">
Creating with AI
</summary>

<div style="padding:20px 24px 24px 24px;">
<div style="border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(41,47,54,0.08); border:1px solid #e3e6ea;">
<div style="background:#F4F6F8; padding:24px;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px; color:#0093A4;">Original Lesson</div>
<div>Students create a visual artwork based on a theme such as identity or community. They sketch ideas, develop a concept, produce a final piece, and write an artist statement explaining their choices.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:#8C52BA; color:white; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:800;">→</div>

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#0093A4;">Small AI Shift</div>
<div>Students generate an AI image based on the theme, analyze it for composition and originality, and then create their own artwork that improves or diverges from the AI version. They explain how the AI influenced their thinking.</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:20px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:16px; color:#0093A4;">Framework Connections</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:16px;">

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/01bcfdad34fbe94df49a42fa383600d1-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.49 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Knowledge</div><div style="font-size:14px;">AI’s Capabilities and Limitations; AI Reflects Human Choices</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/80cec506af206a17886dd8e93fddc5ce-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.44 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Skills</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Creativity; Critical Thinking</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/a15746db2cd10f74f27ff30a58119a8b-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.39 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Attitudes</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Innovative; Adaptable</div></div>
</div>

</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</details>


<!-- Managing AI - Secondary -->
<details style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto 14px auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; background:#FFFFFF; color:#292F36; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px;">
<summary onmouseover="this.style.background='#F2F4F7'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#FFFFFF'" style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 24px; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; color:#141414; list-style:none; border:1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius:16px; background:#FFFFFF;">
Managing AI
</summary>

<div style="padding:20px 24px 24px 24px;">
<div style="border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(41,47,54,0.08); border:1px solid #e3e6ea;">
<div style="background:#F4F6F8; padding:24px;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px; color:#0093A4;">Original Lesson</div>
<div>Students write an argumentative essay with a claim, evidence, and reasoning, revising for clarity and strength of argument.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:#8C52BA; color:white; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">→</div>

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#0093A4;">Small AI Shift</div>
<div>Students choose one stage (brainstorming, outlining, or revising) where AI may be used, explain their reasoning, and reflect on whether AI improved their thinking or writing.</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:20px; background:#FFFFFF;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:16px; color:#0093A4;">Framework Connections</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:16px;">
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;"><img src="https://images.code.org/01bcfdad34fbe94df49a42fa383600d1-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.49 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;"><div><div style="font-weight:700;">Knowledge</div><div style="font-size:14px;">AI’s Capabilities and Limitations; AI’s Role in Society</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;"><img src="https://images.code.org/80cec506af206a17886dd8e93fddc5ce-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.44 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;"><div><div style="font-weight:700;">Skills</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Problem Solving; Communication</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;"><img src="https://images.code.org/a15746db2cd10f74f27ff30a58119a8b-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.39 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;"><div><div style="font-weight:700;">Attitudes</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Responsible; Adaptable</div></div></div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</details>



<!-- Designing AI - Secondary -->
<details style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto 14px auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; background:#FFFFFF; color:#292F36; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px;">
<summary onmouseover="this.style.background='#F2F4F7'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#FFFFFF'" style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 24px; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; color:#141414; list-style:none; border:1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius:16px; background:#FFFFFF;">
Designing AI
</summary>

<div style="padding:20px 24px 24px 24px;">
<div style="border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(41,47,54,0.08); border:1px solid #e3e6ea;">
<div style="background:#F4F6F8; padding:24px;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px; color:#0093A4;">Original Lesson</div>
<div>Students analyze a dataset, create visualizations, and draw conclusions about patterns and trends.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:#8C52BA; color:white; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">→</div>

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#0093A4;">Small AI Shift</div>
<div>Students consider how the dataset could train an AI model, identify missing or biased data, and propose improvements to make predictions more fair and accurate.</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:20px; background:#FFFFFF;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:16px; color:#0093A4;">Framework Connections</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:16px;">
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;"><img src="https://images.code.org/01bcfdad34fbe94df49a42fa383600d1-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.49 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;"><div><div style="font-weight:700;">Knowledge</div><div style="font-size:14px;">AI Reflects Human Choices; AI’s Role in Society</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;"><img src="https://images.code.org/80cec506af206a17886dd8e93fddc5ce-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.44 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;"><div><div style="font-weight:700;">Skills</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Computational Thinking; Self & Social Awareness</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px;"><img src="https://images.code.org/a15746db2cd10f74f27ff30a58119a8b-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.39 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;"><div><div style="font-weight:700;">Attitudes</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Empathetic; Responsible</div></div></div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</details>
